===================================================================
LABORATORIO SOC - CONSULTAS SPL PARA DETECCIÓN DE AMENAZAS
===================================================================

--- 1. Detección de Fuerza Bruta (Event Code 4625) ---
index=main EventCode=4625 
| stats count by IpAddress, TargetUserName, WorkstationName
| where count > 3
| sort - count


--- 2. Monitoreo de Creación de Usuarios (Event Code 4720) ---
index=main EventCode=4720 
| stats count by _time, EventCode, TargetUserName, SubjectUserName, IpAddress
| sort - _time


--- 3. Detección de Modificación de Grupos Privilegiados (Event Code 4732) ---
index=main EventCode=4732 
| stats count by _time, EventCode, TargetUserName, SubjectUserName, GroupName
| sort - _time
